"Ṣeto nọmba awọn kọlàmù fun deskitọpu ati alagbeka, pẹlu aaye ti a le "
"ṣatunṣe."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:4180
#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:4180
msgid "Image captions"
msgstr "Awọn akọle aworan"

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:4181
#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:4181
msgid "Show image captions in the gallery grid and the gallery window."
msgstr "Fihan awọn akọle aworan ni grid gallery ati window gallery."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:4188
#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:4188
