"Ṣafihan abẹ́rẹ́ ti awọn aworan kekere fun lilọ kiri yarayara laarin awọn "
"aworan."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:4196
#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:4196
msgid "Zoom controls"
msgstr "Iṣakoso zoom"

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:4204
#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:4204
