msgstr "Ninu ọpa bulọki, tẹ lori aami Asopọ."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:6137
#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:6137
msgid "Select \"Enlarge on click\"."
msgstr "Yan \"Faagun lori tite\"."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:6143
#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:6143
msgid "How to use: \"Link to Image File\""
msgstr "Bawo ni lati lo: \"Kọkọ si Aworan Faili\""

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:6145
#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:6145
msgid "You can link images directly to their full-size media file. Here's how:"
msgstr "O le so awọn aworan pọ taara si faili media wọn ni iwọn kikun. Eyi ni bi:"

